# rainbow Publications — Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in real values.
# .env MUST be:
#   1. Outside the webroot (one level ABOVE public_html) on production, OR
#   2. At the project root with .htaccess denying direct web access
#   3. Added to .gitignore — never commit real credentials.

